<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>五脏六腑 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%84%8F%E5%85%AD%E8%85%91/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.154.5 &amp; FixIt v0.4.1</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 21 Jan 2026 10:09:09 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%84%8F%E5%85%AD%E8%85%91/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>脏腑阐微篇第十六</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-16/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 16:33:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-16/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过雷公与岐伯的问答，打破了传统“五脏六腑”的定式，提出了**“六脏七腑”**的独特观点，并详细阐释了被忽略的一脏（胞胎）和一腑（包络）的功能与定位。</description></item><item><title>九针论第七十八</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-78/</link><pubDate>Tue, 07 Oct 2025 11:11:11 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-78/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>九针，指九种针具。文中主要论述了九针的起源、命名、形状、用途及禁忌等内容， 故篇名为&amp;quot;九针论&amp;quot;。</description></item><item><title>本藏第四十七</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-47/</link><pubDate>Sat, 06 Sep 2025 17:41:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-47/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>本，即根本。本脏，以脏腑为根本的意思。因文中论述精、神、血、气、魂、魄都藏于五脏，水谷津液则在六腑中传化，脏腑功能正常人体才正常，疾病的发生也是以脏腑功能失常为其根本，故称为&amp;quot;本脏&amp;quot;。</description></item><item><title>示从容论篇第七十六</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE76%E7%A4%BA%E4%BB%8E%E5%AE%B9%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD/</link><pubDate>Wed, 16 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE76%E7%A4%BA%E4%BB%8E%E5%AE%B9%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝教导雷公医术需融会贯通、精准辨证，强调&amp;quot;比类从容&amp;quot;的诊断方法，并通过误诊案例揭示脏腑病机的复杂性。</description></item></channel></rss>